jobs.description:
We’re looking for a reach truck operator who is skilled at driving this type of equipment for a dynamic organization in the Echt region. In this role, you’ll be responsible for handling incoming and outgoing goods using a reach truck. Does working in a clean, well-organized facility energize you? This permanent position offers you job security on the day shift!

Duties:

- Placing pallets of products on shelves using a single-deep or double-deep reach truck;
- Picking orders; 
- Assisting with loading containers; 
- Supporting all logistical tasks as they arise.

You’ll spend most of your time operating the reach truck, so it’s important that you have experience with this type of logistics vehicle. Do you see yourself in this role? Don’t hesitate—read on!

This is a day shift position from 6:00 AM to 3:00 PM, Monday through Friday. 

- Experience operating a reach truck and a certificate demonstrating that you possess the qualities of a good reach truck operator;
- You speak Dutch, English, or German.
